mapping "D413A.1" source="D413A" target="95163004" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source D413A SNOMED CT 95163004 = Swedish ICD-10 national extension subdividing WHO D41.3 (Neoplasm
        of uncertain or unknown behavior of urethra) into the pathologically-uncertain variant. Target
        SNOMED CT 4316746 = (95163004), the Athena crosswalk target for parent D41.3. The SNOMED CT target
        collapses both the uncertain-behavior (A) and unknown-behavior (B) variants into one concept, so
        it subsumes the more specific Swedish source. High tier: verified crosswalk to the parent WHO
        code, one-level broader because the source adds the pathology-vs-clinical distinction the target
        lacks.
        """
}
